    <briefdescription>
<para>Recycle small arrays allocated from a <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a8e612822d4ba7bb36c9c79582a567108" kindref="member">BumpPtrAllocator</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Arrays are allocated in a small number of fixed sizes. For each supported array size, the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_array_recycler" kindref="compound">ArrayRecycler</ref> keeps a free list of available arrays. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
